{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeCarrierSemisimpleReal","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeCarrierSemisimpleReal","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeCarrierEquiv","lean:module:QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeSemisimpleReal","lean:module:QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeCarrierSemisimple"],"declarations":1,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.isSemisimpleRing_iwahoriHecke","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.isSemisimpleRing_iwahoriHecke","kind":"theorem","line":28,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/HeckeCarrierSemisimpleReal.lean#L28-L50","doc":"**`QOU.Hecke.IwahoriHecke` — the `T_w` / `twGram` carrier — is semisimple at every\nrank (sorry-free).**\n\nThis is the carrier item `QOU/SchurWeyl/HeckeSemisimpleGeneral.lean` recorded as\n*not* reached: that file proves semisimplicity for `QOU.SchurWeyl.Hecke`, and the\n`T_w` basis is built on `QOU.Hecke.IwahoriHecke`.  `skeinIwahoriEquiv` transports it.\n\nStated in the Iwahori parameter `Q` directly, which is what consumers of\n`twGram` use. ","signatureChunk":0}]}